        "Each recitation is shown in Arabic with a reading aid and its meaning. Learn the correct pronunciation from a qualified reciter." to "Akhris kasta waxa lagu tusayaa af Carabi iyada oo la socoto qalab wax-akhris iyo macnaheeda. Baro dhawaaqa saxda ah ee akhriye u qalma.",
        "The rulings every worshipper should know. Tap a topic to read it." to "Axkaamta qof kasta oo cibaadaysanaya waa inuu ogaado. Taabo mawduuc si aad u akhrido.",
