        "Witr is Sunnah. Qunut is read after ruku‘ in the second rak‘ah of Fajr, and in Witr during the latter half of Ramadan." to "Witr waa sunne. Qunut waxa la akhriyaa ruku’da ka dib rakcada labaad ee Fajr, iyo Witr inta lagu jiro nuska dambe ee Ramadaan.",
        "Witr is Sunnah, commonly a single rak‘ah after two rak‘at of shaf‘. The details of the Fajr Qunut vary within the school." to "Witr waa sunne, caadiyan waa hal rakco ka dib laba rakcadood oo shaf ah. Faahfaahinta Fajr Qunut way ku kala duwan yihiin gudaha dugsiga.",
