        "Sit on the left foot laid flat, keep the right foot upright with its toes towards the Qibla, and rest the hands on the thighs near the knees." to "Ku fadhiiso lugta bidix oo si siman u jiifsan, lugta midigna ku toosi suulasha dhinaca Qiblada, gacmahana ku dheji bowdada jilbaha agtooda.",
        "Sit on the left hip with both feet out to the right side, and rest the hands on the thighs with the fingers together." to "Ku fadhiiso sinta bidix iyadoo labada cagood u soo baxay dhinaca midig, oo gacmaha ku naji bowdada adiga oo faraha iskula jira.",
        "At ‘ash-hadu al-la ilaha’ raise the index finger of the right hand, and lower it at ‘illallah’." to "Marka ‘ash-hadu al-la ilaha’ kor u taag farta murtida ee gacanta midig, oo hoos u dhig ‘illallah’.",
        "These steps follow the Hanafi method. In the Shafi‘i school: the hands are folded above the navel; the opening dua is ‘Wajjahtu wajhiya…’; Bismillah is recited as part of al-Fatihah and Ameen is said aloud in the loud prayers; the hands are raised when going into ruku‘ and when rising from it; the follower also recites al-Fatihah; and Qunut is read in Fajr after the ruku‘ of the second rak‘ah. Learn the details from a teacher of your school." to "Tallaabooyinkani waxay raacaan habka Xanafiga. Dugsiga Shaafici: gacmihii waxay laalaabeen xuddunta korkeeda; ducada furitaanka waa ‘Wajjahtu wajxiya…’; Bismillah waxaa lagu akhriyaa qayb ka mid ah al-Faatixa iyo Amiin oo kor loogu dhawaaqayo salaadaha dhawaaqa; gacmaha ayaa kor loo qaadayaa marka la galayo rukuucda iyo marka laga soo kacayo; raacuhu wuxuu kaloo akhriyaa al-Faatixa; waxaana Qunut lagu akhriyaa Fajarka kadib rukuucda rakcada labaad. Faahfaahinta ka baro macalinka dugsigaaga.",
        "These steps follow the Hanafi method. In the Maliki school: the arms are commonly left at the sides; no opening dua, Ta‘awwuz or Bismillah is recited in a Fard prayer; the follower does not recite behind the imam in the loud prayers; Qunut is read quietly in Fajr; and the prayer is ended with one obligatory salam. Learn the details from a teacher of your school." to "Tallaabooyinkani waxay raacaan habka Xanafiga. Iskuulka Maaliki: Gacmaha ayaa sida caadiga ah looga tago dhinacyada; Duco furitaan ah ma jiro, Ta'awwuz ama Bismillah ayaa lagu akhriyaa salaad Farad; raacuhu kuma akhriyo imaamka gadaashiisa salaadaha qaylada; Qunut si deggan baa loo akhriyaa Fajr; waxaana salaadda lagu dhammeeyaa hal salaan oo waajib ah. Faahfaahinta ka baro macalinka dugsigaaga.",
        "These steps follow the Hanafi method. In the Hanbali school: the same Thana is recited; Ameen is said aloud in the loud prayers; the hands are raised when going into ruku‘ and when rising from it; ‘Rabbighfir li’ between the two sajdahs is required; and Witr is commonly prayed as two rak‘at and then one, with Qunut after ruku‘. Learn the details from a teacher of your school." to "Tallaabooyinkani waxay raacaan habka Xanafiga. Dugsiga Xanbali: isla Thana ayaa lagu akhriyaa; Ameen ayaa si qaylo ah loogu yidhi salaadaha qaylada; gacmaha ayaa kor loo qaadayaa marka la galayo rukuucda iyo marka laga soo kacayo; ‘Rabbighfir li’ inta u dhaxaysa labada sajadood ayaa la rabaa; Witr-ka waxa lagu tukadaa laba rakcadood ka dibna hal, iyadoo Qunut lagu tukado rukummada dabadeed. Faahfaahinta ka baro macalinka dugsigaaga.",
        "Before you begin" to "Kahor intaadan bilaabin",
        "Be in wudu with a clean body, clean clothes and a clean place; cover the awrah; make sure the time of the prayer has entered; and stand facing the Qibla." to "Ku dhex jir wudu leh jidh nadiif ah, dhar nadiif ah iyo meel nadiif ah; cawrada dabooli; hubi in wakhtiga salaadda la galay; una istaagaan dhanka Qiblada.",
        "Keep about four fingers' space between the feet." to "Ku hay meel bannaan oo afar farood ah cagaha dhexdooda.",
        "Niyyah (intention)" to "Niyyah (ujeedo)",
        "Intend in your heart which prayer you are offering, for example ‘two rak‘at Fard of Fajr, for Allah’. Saying it with the tongue is recommended, not required." to "Qalbigaaga ku nijaw salaadda aad tukanayso, tusaale ahaan ‘laba rak’at Fard of Fajr, ee Alle’. In carrabka lagu sheego ayaa lagu talinayaa, looma baahna.",
        "Also intend that you are following this imam." to "Sidoo kale ku talaji inaad raacdo imaamkan.",
        "Takbir-e-Tahrimah" to "Takbir-e-Taxrimah",
        "Raise both hands until the thumbs touch the earlobes, palms facing the Qibla, and say Allahu Akbar. Then lower them and place the right hand over the left below the navel." to "Labada gacmood kor u qaad ilaa suulka ay taabtaan xuubka dhegta, calaacashana waxay u jeedaan Qiblada, oo dheh Allaahu Akbar. Ka dibna hoos u dhig oo dhig gacanta midig ee bidixda ka hooseeya xuddunta.",
        "Raise both hands to the shoulders, keeping them inside the shawl, and say Allahu Akbar. Then place the right palm over the back of the left hand on the chest." to "Labada gacmood kor u qaad garbaha, adigoo ku haynaya shawlka gudihiisa, oo dheh Allaahu Akbar. Dabadeed calaacasha midig saar xagga dambe ee gacanta bidix laabta.",
        "While standing, keep your eyes on the place of sajdah." to "Markaad taagan tahay, isha ku hay meesha sajdah.",
